---
description: Backend architecture rules
globs:
  - "backend/**/*.py"
  - "scripts/**/*.py"
  - "agents/**/*.py"
---

# Backend stack
- Python 3.11+
- FastAPI
- Pydantic v2
- asyncio
- structlog
- httpx

# Backend conventions
- Keep agent logic in dedicated classes.
- Use async-first code paths.
- Validate inputs and outputs with schemas.
- Return structured event objects.
- Keep orchestration separate from business logic.

# Implementation rules
- Add tests for new behavior.
- Use dependency injection for LLM, memory, and connectors.
- Do not hardcode secrets.
- Preserve demo data mode.
